OL,3,GNEWSAHenry Nowak killer's sentence
OL,4,Abeing reviewed by Court of Appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FJonathan Polnay KC, for the Attorney
OL,7,FGeneral, argued Digwa's 21-year minimum
OL,8,Fterm was too lenient, citing his use of
OL,9,Fa kirpan, abusing the religious
OL,10,Fexemption to carry it, and his conduct
OL,11,Fas Henry Nowak lay dying
OL,13,FThe case gained international attention
OL,14,Fafter it emerged Digwa falsely claimed
OL,15,Fhe was the victim of a racist attack,
OL,16,Fleading to Nowak being handcuffed as he
OL,17,Flay dying
OL,19,FJudgement is expected at 15:30 GMT
